The project is named "SylLexer".
The version is "1.0.0".
The target is a standalone executable.

Note: Syl v1.0 Self-Hosting Lexer.

Print "Syl Self-Hosting Lexer Proof starting...".

Read "sentinel.syl" as source_code.
List words in source_code as words.

Print "Found " and words_count and " words.".

For each word in words:
    If word is "Set":
        Print "[ TOKEN ] KEYWORD: Set".
    If word is "Print":
        Print "[ TOKEN ] KEYWORD: Print".
    If word is "Entity":
        Print "[ TOKEN ] KEYWORD: Entity".

Print "Analysis complete.".
